#: includes/section/setup/botblocker-setup-chain.php:68
#| msgid ""
#| "Early Init and MU plugin modes reject requests at the first gate: IPs on "
#| "the blacklist (bots, malicious networks, previously blocked) are dropped "
#| "before heavier logic runs. With Early Init, WordPress does not load at "
#| "all — saving memory and CPU. The MU plugin filters before regular plugins "
#| "and the theme. Only clean traffic proceeds; junk is dropped as early as "
#| "possible."
msgid ""
"Early Init and MU plugin modes reject requests at the first gate: IPs on the "
"blacklist (bots, malicious networks, previously blocked) are dropped before "
"heavier logic runs. With Early Init, WordPress does not load at all - saving "
"memory and CPU. The MU plugin filters before regular plugins and the theme. "
"Only clean traffic proceeds; junk is dropped as early as possible."
msgstr ""
"Les modes Early Init et MU plugin rejettent les demandes à la première porte "
": Les IP figurant sur la liste noire (bots, réseaux malveillants, "
"précédemment bloqués) sont rejetées avant l'exécution d'une logique plus "
"lourde. Avec Early Init, WordPress ne se charge pas du tout, ce qui permet "
"d'économiser de la mémoire et de l'énergie. Le plugin MU filtre avant les "
"plugins ordinaires et le thème. Seul le trafic propre est pris en compte ; "
"le trafic indésirable est éliminé le plus tôt possible."

